TITLE 1D transport with exchange; SI(H2O(g)) at cell 4, shift 10

SOLUTION 1-10  Initial solution for all cells
    pH      7.0
    Ca      1.0
    Cl      2.0

SOLUTION 0  Influent solution
    pH      7.0
    Na      1.0
    Cl      1.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X   0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions constant constant
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -dispersivity 0
    -correct_disp false
    -time_step 1
    -lengths 1
    -print_cells 4
    -print_frequency 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -file selected.txt
    -high_precision true
    -si H2O(g)

END
